From 4e1d3250b7a978947d8dd47a7920e9af8496d234 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lucas Garfield <lucas@local>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 22:13:29 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] image-builder: state NOASSERTION licenses on the SBOM
 image root

The image root package in the image SBOM had no license fields at all,
so a reader could not tell whether the license was unknown or simply
not emitted. The image is an assembly of many separately licensed RPMs
(each listed with its own licenseDeclared), so no single license can be
asserted for it: set licenseDeclared and licenseConcluded to NOASSERTION.
